  book_title: "Story Time, Issue 10 \u2014 Late May 2000"
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: -1
  content: 
  clue_content: "2 Jokes:\nThe Power of Prayer\nTom complained to a friend, \u201CWhat
    good is prayer? My son wants a bicycle for Christmas, but I can\u2019t afford
    one. I prayed all night, and there\u2019s still no bicycle!\u201D\n\u201CYou\u2019re
    going about it the wrong way,\u201D his friend said. \u201CSteal a bicycle for
    your son first. Then pray for forgiveness.\u201D\n\nFather Knows Best\n\u201CGood
    heavens!\u201D his wife shouted furiously. \u201CYour son has smashed the piano
    to pieces!\u201D\nHer husband replied calmly, \u201CI told you he\u2019d make
    a better blacksmith than a pianist.\u201D"
